[[File:S2E31 Wildwood Druid spores 2.jpg|thumb|Wildwood Druid's toxic spores]]
Wildwood Druid is able to control leaves and roots, using her roots to immobilize her enemies. She can control these roots to grow from spots in the ground and capture her target much like the ability of [[Dark Dryad]]. She is also capable of releasing with toxic spores that can prove lethal to Titans like [[Sorcerel]] and [[Gigadrone]]. For Seekers, the only way to counter these spores is by holding one's breath. {{source|Chasing Void}}

